Package: wifibridge
Version: 1.0.5
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jeremy Leonard <jeremyl@efgsystems.com>
Depends: systemd, systemd-resolved, iwd, hostapd, strongswan-swanctl, nftables
Homepage: https://github.com/jeremyleonard/wifibridge
Description: WifiBridge travel router and VPN gateway daemon
 A headless network appliance management daemon and Web UI designed for
 Debian 13 (Trixie). Turns a Linux device with eth0, wlan0, and wlan1 into
 an always-on travel router and VPN gateway.
